tedAt":"2026-10-19T14:34:21Z","digest":"sha256:77336ca3ba5ada14aa4b024dba8700cca97e4975f6e1e11a6e1281d6d417fb03","downloadCount":0,"id":"RA_kwDOVPcXOs4nIcSw","label":"","name":"UP-Term-src.lha","size":101438243,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-10-19T14:34:55Z","url":"https://github.com/spotUP/vtcon/releases/download/v1.1/UP-Term-src.lha"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/spotUP/vtcon/releases/assets/656525266","contentType":"application/vnd.shana.informed.package","createdAt":"2026-10-19T14:34:37Z","digest":"sha256:92afb969cb1998404a0a7ce23b06e0d40375c3137d0cb2187de783156934ca0c","downloadCount":0,"id":"RA_kwDOVPcXOs4nIcfS","label":"","name":"UP-Term-vim_1.0_m68k-amigaos.ipk","size":3592466,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-10-19T14:34:40Z","url":"https://github.com/spotUP/vtcon/releases/download/v1.1/UP-Term-vim_1.0_m68k-amigaos.ipk"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/spotUP/vtcon/releases/assets/656524467","contentType":"application/x-lzh-compressed","createdAt":"2026-10-19T14:34:21Z","digest":"sha256:45e79704ff7a0a745023c83dc0d27493de184eff50255c4b12eb2f8e2112b86d","downloadCount":0,"id":"RA_kwDOVPcXOs4nIcSz","label":"","name":"UP-Term.lha","size":25607921,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-10-19T14:34:41Z","url":"https://github.com/spotUP/vtcon/releases/download/v1.1/UP-Term.lha"},{"apiUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/spotUP/vtcon/releases/assets/656524272","contentType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","createdAt":"2026-10-19T14:34:17Z","digest":"sha256:96de1089e00d43c96bae6b059f371ba0dddbc01a97d17cc4d8b34c0667b2f107","downloadCount":0,"id":"RA_kwDOVPcXOs4nIcPw","label":"","name":"upkg-index.txt","size":628,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-10-19T14:34:17Z","url":"https://github.com/spotUP/vtcon/releases/download/v1.1/upkg-index.txt"}],"body":"UP-Term v1.1: a smaller base archive.\n\ngit, perl and vim are no longer in UP-Term.lha. Install them with the package manager when you want them:\n\n    upkg install git\n    upkg install perl\n    upkg install vim\n\nThey install at the same paths as before, so scripts and habits that used them keep working.\n\nChanges\n- UP-Term.lha is about 14 MB smaller (39.7 MB to 25.6 MB).\n- The git package is smaller too: git-upload-pack, git-receive-pack and git-upload-archive are now small scripts that run git, not three more copies of the 3.7 MB binary.\n- Help > Slash commands lists the slash commands. While a program has the screen, it shows a short requester instead.\n- EDITOR defaults to joe when you have not set one, so fc and git commit open an editor on the base install. An EDITOR you set is kept.\n\nUpdating from v1.0\n- Run the v1.1 installer over v1.0. The git, perl and vim files that v1.0 installed stay where they are and are recorded as packages, so `upkg update` and `upkg remove` handle them from now on.\n\nBuilt from spotUP/UP-Term 3ec3541a (tag v1.1) and upterm-ports 171cf8b.\n","createdAt":"2026-10-19T10:56:28Z","name":"UP-Term 1.1","tagName":"v1.1","targetCommitish":"main"}
